---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro'
---

<Base title="Terms of Service — Atlas">
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-text">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-text-muted">Last updated: July 2026</p>

    <div class="mt-8 space-y-6 text-text leading-relaxed">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-text">Acceptance</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-text-muted">By using Atlas, you agree to these terms. If you do not agree, do not use the service.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-text">Service description</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-text-muted">Atlas is a personal news aggregation service. It fetches content from public sources, scores it using AI, and delivers personalized digests. The service is provided "as is" without warranties.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-text">User responsibilities</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-text-muted">You are responsible for the sources you configure and the content you submit to the source market. Do not submit sources that violate third-party terms of service.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-text">Limitation of liability</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-text-muted">Atlas is not liable for any damages arising from use of the service. AI-generated scores and summaries may contain errors. Use at your own discretion.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-text">Termination</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-text-muted">We may terminate your account at any time for violation of these terms. You may delete your account at any time by contacting us on GitHub.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-text">License</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-text-muted">Atlas is open source under the AGPL-3.0 license. See the <a href="https://github.com/pantha704/atlas/blob/main/LICENSE">LICENSE</a> file for details.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</Base>
